{
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Hello! Thanks for contacting Nimbus Telecom. My name is Meera. How can I help you today? 😊",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Meera. I'm Aisha Nair. My internet has been dropping all day and I also noticed a weird $45 charge on my bill this month. It's really annoying because I need to work.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I need to pull up your account first. Please provide your account number and date of birth.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Sure, my account number is 52164119 and my date of birth is 06/12/1980. My phone is 95591 23743.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thanks. I see the connection drops in your area. I am going to raise a network ticket for our engineering team to investigate this.",
      "tags": [
        "action:technician_or_ticket"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Okay... but when will it be fixed? I've lost hours of work today. And what about that $45 charge? It says 'premium support' which I never ordered.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I will raise a refund request for the $45 premium support charge now.",
      "tags": [
        "action:refund_request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Is that it? You just 'raise a request'? I want to know if I'm actually getting my money back today. This is terrible service.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Please note that all refund requests are subject to approval by our billing department. The review process takes 7-10 business days.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "7 to 10 days?? That is ridiculous! You guys charge me for stuff I didn't ask for, my internet is broken, and you won't even guarantee a refund? I am extremely unhappy with this chat.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I have logged the network ticket and submitted the refund request for approval. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? Thank you for chatting with Nimbus Telecom, goodbye.",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
